{"id":"n57639-1-8","stage":3,"title":"반창고 · 橡皮膏","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n57639-1-8-1","ko":"팔에 왜 반창고를 붙였니?","zh":"你胳膊上为什么贴着创可贴？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"팔에","meaning":"臂，胳膊","explanation":"팔：臂，胳膊；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"팔","audio":"/audio/aab1afda0edcd3aeba74.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32794","senseId":"1","lemma":"팔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"팔에","audio":"/audio/8e3aa3c2f8a993023289.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"반창고를","meaning":"橡皮膏，创可贴","explanation":"반창고：橡皮膏，创可贴；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"반창고","audio":"/audio/fe3b955fadb0965756b6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57639","senseId":"1","lemma":"반창고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"반창고를","audio":"/audio/33aa582ee7a6b93eba01.mp3"}},{"text":"붙였니?","meaning":"粘，贴，粘贴","explanation":"붙이다：粘，贴，粘贴；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"붙이다","audio":"/audio/f50e3cbdb3c8dd13b787.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60293","senseId":"1","lemma":"붙이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"붙였니","audio":"/audio/272ea85c3c75c5b5915c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"aab1afda0edcd3ae","term":"팔","zh":"臂，胳膊","audio":"/audio/aab1afda0edcd3aeba74.mp3","entryId":"32794","definition":"肩以下，手腕以上的部分。","pronunciation":["팔"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"fe3b955fadb09657","term":"반창고","zh":"橡皮膏，创可贴","audio":"/audio/fe3b955fadb0965756b6.mp3","entryId":"57639","definition":"一面涂有粘性物质的胶布或胶带，作用在于把软膏、绷带等贴在皮肤上。","pronunciation":["반창고"]},{"id":"f50e3cbdb3c8dd13","term":"붙이다","zh":"粘，贴，粘贴","audio":"/audio/f50e3cbdb3c8dd13b787.mp3","entryId":"60293","definition":"使某物附在某处而不脱落。","pronunciation":["부치다"]}],"audio":"/audio/48b78715b7117cd77bd6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n57639-1-8-2","ko":"돌부리에 걸려 넘어지면서 팔에 상처가 났어요.","zh":"是被石子绊倒了，胳膊才受伤的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"돌부리에","meaning":"(地面露出的)石头尖角，石头尖儿","explanation":"돌부리：(地面露出的)石头尖角，石头尖儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"돌부리","audio":"/audio/e37215cafe89671373f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48287","senseId":"1","lemma":"돌부리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돌부리에","audio":"/audio/080cddb60cbfe1529f0d.mp3"}},{"text":"걸려","meaning":"被勾，被绊","explanation":"걸리다：被勾，被绊；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"걸리다","audio":"/audio/d94590a358564fb83462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86940","senseId":"17","lemma":"걸리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸려","audio":"/audio/794467180c643d4431c1.mp3"}},{"text":"넘어지면서","meaning":"跌倒，倒下，摔倒","explanation":"넘어지다：跌倒，倒下，摔倒；면서：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"넘어지다","audio":"/audio/b95cf11ab79489dac5a0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62363","senseId":"1","lemma":"넘어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넘어지면서","audio":"/audio/bc930b8268c8111c2cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"팔에","meaning":"臂，胳膊","explanation":"팔：臂，胳膊；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"팔","audio":"/audio/aab1afda0edcd3aeba74.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32794","senseId":"1","lemma":"팔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"팔에","audio":"/audio/8e3aa3c2f8a993023289.mp3"}},{"text":"상처가","meaning":"伤口，伤","explanation":"상처：伤口，伤；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"상처","audio":"/audio/005223fd14eafcaf1ee3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62979","senseId":"1","lemma":"상처","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"상처가","audio":"/audio/3ea744d1ff0e11e81dc6.mp3"}},{"text":"났어요.","meaning":"钻，打，划","explanation":"나다：钻，打，划；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"3","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"났어요","audio":"/audio/d2257d19ac11ac6e987c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e37215cafe896713","term":"돌부리","zh":"(地面露出的)石头尖角，石头尖儿","audio":"/audio/e37215cafe89671373f1.mp3","entryId":"48287","definition":"位于地下的石头突出于地面的部分。","pronunciation":["돌ː뿌리"]},{"id":"d94590a358564fb8","term":"걸리다","zh":"被勾，被绊","audio":"/audio/d94590a358564fb83462.mp3","entryId":"86940","definition":"腿、脚等被某物碰撞。","pronunciation":["걸리다"]},{"id":"b95cf11ab79489da","term":"넘어지다","zh":"跌倒，倒下，摔倒","audio":"/audio/b95cf11ab79489dac5a0.mp3","entryId":"62363","definition":"站立着的人或物失去重心，倾向一边而倒下。","pronunciation":["너머지다"]},{"id":"aab1afda0edcd3ae","term":"팔","zh":"臂，胳膊","audio":"/audio/aab1afda0edcd3aeba74.mp3","entryId":"32794","definition":"肩以下，手腕以上的部分。","pronunciation":["팔"]},{"id":"005223fd14eafcaf","term":"상처","zh":"伤口，伤","audio":"/audio/005223fd14eafcaf1ee3.mp3","entryId":"62979","definition":"身体受伤而生出的伤处。","pronunciation":["상처"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"钻，打，划","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"出现洞或伤口等。","pronunciation":["나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1d1c1b861c481d10963f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.051,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=57639","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":111,"sequenceScore":2.8777,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是被石子绊倒了，胳膊才受伤的。","你胳膊上为什么贴着创可贴？","还要走很久才能到吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你胳膊上为什么贴着创可贴？","还要走很久才能到吗？","是被石子绊倒了，胳膊才受伤的。"],"answer":2}]}
